/*
SERIES: Vibecode Town — Season 1
EPISODE: 01 — "바이브코딩이 뭔가?" / "What Is Vibe Coding?"
VERSION: v5.0 (7:30 expansion)
SEGMENT STRUCTURE: 6-segment (HOOK → MISCONCEPTION → THE_CRACK → CORE → REFRAME → OUTRO_CTA)
TARGET DURATION: 7:00-7:30
NARRATOR: English V.O. only. Vee is SILENT.
SSOT: systems/video/SERIES_BIBLE.md
WORD COUNT: ~1,100 narration words / 50-55 beats
